WEBVTT

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:15.420
City.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.840
This is the Garment District.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.200
Within a few short city blocks, thousands of workers produce most of America's clothing.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:26.060
But behind these streets is the real world.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.780
A teeming jungle of conflict, brutal competition.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.820
and terror.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.840
